	/// Deleted, 10.2: FileSize * min(DeletedRowCount, RowCount) / RowCount, or the sum of the same estimate over the files when the footprint keeps them. Over the tables of the last collection day in the period, each table once, from its latest collection of that day.
	measure 'Deleted' =
			VAR LastDay = MAX ( Footprints[collectionDate] )
